    Static testing CTFL chapter 3
      What
        Examines work products without executing them
        Reviews: informal, walkthrough, technical review, inspection
        Static analysis by tools
      Applies to
        Requirements and user stories
        Architecture and design models
        Source code
        Test plans, test cases, test charters
        Contracts and manuals
      Where it fits
        A form of testing, therefore QC
        Shift-left: from the first work products onward
        In test analysis: evaluate the test basis
        Complements dynamic testing
      Static vs dynamic §3.1.3
        Static finds defects directly
        Dynamic causes failures, then defects are analysed
        Static can find defects in non-executable work products
